there are three new signs a russian  invasion could be imminent so what are  they  well the first main indicator has been  observed at a training camp in russian  occupied crimea known as the angerski  training area  growing activity has been identified  here in the last two months including  the appearance of light brown  rectangular tents and another structure  to the north a military analyst has said  this is likely to be a new field  hospital and this is seen as a  significant development because field  hospitals are of course designed to  treat wounded soldiers unless they're  being used during a military exercise  as we've heard in the past couple of  weeks the camp has also seen an influx  of military personnel 60 large tents  have appeared which sleep up to 20  soldiers each and to the south another  15 tents have been identified so far  this year  now faint rectangular indentations in  the snow near the hospital suggest a  number of tents have also been moved  the second significant development is at  novu zen a base 65 miles north west of  angerski also in crimea  new military tents have also appeared  alongside equipment that has been there  since last spring  now satellite images from there show the  difference from the end of december  where there's all this empty space  and it now looks like this with the  capacity to accommodate a significant  amount of more troops  now the third development concerns the  movement of equipment belonging to  rosgvardia a russian militarized  internal police force in the direction  of the ukrainian border responding is a  russian internal security force that's  equipped like a paramilitary force with  heavy equipment and with equipment for  inflicting mass casualties it's designed  not only to help the russian state  control its own citizenry but also to  keep control of occupied territories  when russia mounts an assault in another  country and that's why it's significant  that it's now being moved to join the  forces that are poised opposite the  ukrainian border because it gives russia  the capacity to hold territory that it  sees from ukraine as well as just attack  it  these same researchers have been  analyzing social media posts to track  their equipment moving in russia and  they've identified a truck moving south  from northwest russia with a gold emblem  of the security force on its side  russia's intentions remain unclear but  there is only a limited amount of  further escalation possible with experts  saying any final movements before an  invasion could come from the air
 

